(ii) Enumerate Multiplication and Division Operations Between Matrices and Vectors
Theory

R supports different kinds of multiplication and division involving matrices and vectors:

Element-wise multiplication
Matrix multiplication
Scalar multiplication
Matrix–vector multiplication
Element-wise division
Scalar division
Program
# Matrix

A <- matrix(c(1,2,3,4),2,2)

# Vector

v <- c(5,6)

print("Matrix")

print(A)

print("Vector")

print(v)

# Matrix × Vector

result1 <- A %*% v

print("Matrix Vector Multiplication")

print(result1)

# Element-wise Multiplication

result2 <- A * v

print("Element-wise Multiplication")

print(result2)

# Scalar Multiplication

result3 <- A * 10

print(result3)

# Element-wise Division

result4 <- A / v

print("Element-wise Division")

print(result4)

# Scalar Division

result5 <- A / 2

print(result5)
